  "about_research_text": "Every claim we make is verifiable and based on established technical knowledge. We don't invent features or exaggerate capabilities. We acknowledge limitations and uncertainties when they exist. If a stuck pixel repair method has no reliable success rate, we tell you that. If something isn't guaranteed, we say so. This commitment to honesty means you can trust our information for making real decisions about your screens.",
